name subdocs
category Package
revision 51480
shortdesc Multifile documents
longdesc This is an experimental package aiming to provide a different
longdesc approach for multidocument works (mainly, books with a document
longdesc per chapter). Unlike the \include mechanism, every subdocument
longdesc is a complete normal LaTeX document and may be typeset
longdesc separately. What the package does is sharing the .aux files.
longdesc The present release is an alpha version, and no attempt has yet
longdesc been made to allow it to work with, say, hyperref.
